Description:
 edulution-linbo-vdi - VDI service for linuxmuster.net on Proxmox
Changes:
 edulution-linbo-vdi (1.1.6) noble; urgency=medium
 .
   * vdi-setup no longer crashes with KeyError: 'group' at the VDI group
     prompt; every OS preset carries its default group name.
   * The Proxmox role no longer lists VM.Monitor for Proxmox VE 9, which
     removed it. The wizard and the docs give the PVE 8 and PVE 9 privilege
     lists separately.
   * A failed connection test tells 401 (check user, token name, token value)
     apart from 403 (missing privileges).
